    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Tier 2 — Dream-Cache.</strong> Between scenes, you may bank one manifestation in a dream slot. The next scene, deploy it without paying Clarity — you still pay upkeep from your live pool.</p>\n<p style=\"opacity:0.7;font-size:0.85em\">Discipline (passive): Clarity max +1 (stacks with Tier 1 to total +3).</p>\n<p style=\"opacity:0.7;font-size:0.85em\">Carryover: while you carry an active Dream-Cache, you reroll the lowest die on checks vs. illusion / fear / corruption (the cached manifestation is itself a hedge against unreality).</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"dwT2\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Dream-Cache</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/scene (between) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Free (between scenes) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Bank one manifestation in a dream slot between scenes; deploy next scene without paying Clarity (still pay upkeep). While the cache is active, reroll lowest on checks vs. illusion / fear / corruption.</div>\n</div>",
